# Generated config. `llmrouter-make-config` normally writes these to
# /mnt/shuttle/share/app-data/llmrouter/config, which is outside the repo, but
# a run with `--out .` would land them here. The deploy path itself is
# absolute and outside the repo, so git never sees it. model_capabilities.csv
# is deliberately absent from this list: it is tracked source data at the repo
# root, and the generator only ever copies it outwards.
/providers.yml
/models.yml
/intelligence.yml
/router.yml

